{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"coreyhaines31--marketingskills--directory-submissions","name":"directory-submissions","description":"When the user wants to submit their product to startup, SaaS, AI, agent, MCP, no-code, or review directories for backlinks, domain rating, and discovery. Also use when the user mentions \"directory submissions,\" \"submit to directories,\" \"backlinks from directories,\" \"list my product,\" \"submit to Product Hunt,\" \"BetaList,\" \"TAAFT,\" \"Futurepedia,\" \"G2 listing,\" \"Capterra listing,\" \"AlternativeTo,\" \"SaaSHub,\" \"AI directories,\" \"MCP registry,\" \"agent directory,\" \"dofollow backlinks,\" \"launch directories,\" or \"directory tracker.\" Use this whenever someone is planning the directory layer of a product launch or an ongoing backlink campaign. For the broader launch moment, see launch. For programmatic SEO pages that should live behind these backlinks, see programmatic-seo. For AI citation optimization, see ai-seo.","category":"Marketing","tags":["directory","submissions","when","user","wants","submit","their","product","startup","saas","ai","agent","mcp","no","code","review","directories","backlinks"],"repo":"coreyhaines31/marketingskills","owner":"coreyhaines31","stars":51366,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"5b2c0007766c6a1cf1d53fd8fc73e979e0821022","path":"skills/directory-submissions","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/coreyhaines31/marketingskills/tree/5b2c0007766c6a1cf1d53fd8fc73e979e0821022/skills/directory-submissions","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-05T04:48:02Z","fileCount":6,"bytes":87640,"sha256":"dd08854f5cd1e16413dd588b13e02a32ce01dd3a9f4e9b1099f92a7b635ac24a","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"skills/directory-submissions/SKILL.md","bytes":23361,"sha256":"dd08854f5cd1e16413dd588b13e02a32ce01dd3a9f4e9b1099f92a7b635ac24a","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/coreyhaines31/market